  "said.cohorts.f0b50e14": "Session added to the schedule.",
  "said.cohorts.f5cc88e2": "No such qualification.",
  "said.cohorts.fb75334d": "The schedule names a step that is not on this cohort's course.",
  "said.conduct.07e411c2": "Say what the grievance is about, in the learner's own words where possible.",
  "said.conduct.0f2a2196": "The grievance names {firstName} {lastName}. A person the complaint is about cannot investigate it: the procedure requires a designated impartial person. Please appoint someone else.",
  "said.conduct.1d25ed57": "The notice has to state the specific allegations. A hearing about unstated allegations cannot be answered.",
  "said.conduct.1e2d5837": "Recorded. The five working days to appeal run from today.",
  "said.conduct.1efe5ff4": "Hearing not found.",
  "said.conduct.286bf7e2": "Case not found.",
  "said.conduct.2ba40cef": "A hearing needs at least {HEARING_NOTICE_HOURS} hours' notice and this is {hours} hours short. The earliest it can be held is {earliest}. Inadequate notice would allow an appeal to succeed whatever the facts of the case.",
  "said.conduct.2fcf5b34": "The decision goes to the learner in writing and must say what was found and what will be done.",
  "said.conduct.303f7f08": "Say what sanctions are possible, including termination where it is. A learner deciding whether to bring assistance needs to know what is at stake.",
  "said.conduct.4dcaf05f": "That is not a date and time.",
  "said.conduct.53c39e91": "Please record in full what was found and on what basis.",
  "said.conduct.54eb7eaa": "Ending a learner's programme needs a hearing that was held, with its findings recorded. Convene one, record what was found, then close the case.",
  "said.conduct.57024d2f": "State the rule broken, the standard expected and what happens if it recurs. A warning must state all three.",
  "said.conduct.64f7462f": "The notice must tell the learner they may be assisted by a fellow learner, present their case, and call and question witnesses. Send a notice that does, then record it here.",
  "said.conduct.6a6b5da7": "It has to be acknowledged by {acknowledgeBy}.",
  "said.conduct.77c80d2a": "Lodged. It will be acknowledged within two working days.",
  "said.conduct.8d0ef3ad": "Hearing convened. The notice period is met.",
  "said.conduct.8f73cd86": "Warning not found.",
  "said.conduct.9f172fca": "The learner cannot investigate their own grievance.",
  "said.conduct.b0301d88": "Say what is alleged, specifically. A learner cannot answer 'poor attitude', and neither can a hearing.",
  "said.conduct.b0dcbd53": "Decided, and the learner has it in writing.",
  "said.conduct.c0b5ee62": "That case is closed.",
  "said.conduct.cf47131c": "Closed. Give the learner the outcome in writing, then record that you have.",
  "said.conduct.d56fece4": "Grievance not found.",
  "said.conduct.d58db695": "A hearing needs at least {HEARING_NOTICE_HOURS} hours' notice and this is {hours} hour short. The earliest it can be held is {earliest}. Inadequate notice would allow an appeal to succeed whatever the facts of the case.",
  "said.conduct.ee53edb5": "That person was not found.",
  "said.conduct.ee8d0855": "Please give the reasons. An unexplained sanction cannot be defended, and the learner is entitled to the reasons.",
  "said.conduct.fdc79fcb": "A grievance has been lodged",
