  "said.enrolment-document-shape.8d2c9fdc": "The copy is not legible. Please scan or photograph it again, flat and in good light.",
  "said.enrolment-document-shape.a7aecdc1": "The ID has more than one certification date on it. Please supply a copy certified once, recently.",
