  "said.enrolment-form.141771ac": "From the STATSSA area code list the QCTO publishes.",
  "said.enrolment-form.158eb69b": "The return asks whether the learner agreed, and on what date.",
  "said.enrolment-form.3ecff80b": "The gender recorded does not match the one in the identity number. The QCTO checks this, so one of the two is mistyped.",
  "said.enrolment-form.5d06240c": "The date of birth recorded ({recorded}) does not match the identity number, which says {fromId}.",
  "said.enrolment-form.7d5cda8a": "Confirmed, and the date recorded. Change anything here later and it will ask you to confirm again.",
