  "said.spine.09e0bbde": "A {kind} step has to name the {kind2} it points at.",
  "said.spine.0b4713d6": "\"{title}\" is formative, so it never produces a competence decision, so a gate waiting for one would never open. Wait for it to be handed in or marked instead.",
  "said.spine.129de092": "Say why this learner is being let past. It is shown on their record and in the moderation pack.",
