  "said.spine.7287fb1d": "A lesson or a document is not assessed, so it cannot be judged competent. Wait for it to be opened instead.",
  "said.spine.81239e1c": "Only a work experience module is signed off. Pick another rule.",
  "said.spine.817ed9df": "Opens when you are placed in a cohort.",
